What happened
  Your wallet does not hold enough USDC: it has 0 USDC and the transaction needed 1,000,000,000 USDC.

Why
  The transaction tried to move 1,000,000,000 USDC out of your wallet, but that wallet only held 0 USDC when it ran. The token contract does not allow spending more than a wallet holds, so it stopped the transaction.

What you can do
  - Your wallet holds none USDC: add at least 1,000,000,000 USDC before trying to send that much.
  - Check the amount's decimals: a value typed in whole tokens must be multiplied by the token's decimals before sending.

